Package: mboostrs
Type: Package
Title: Component-Wise Gradient Boosting with a Rust Core
Version: 0.2.5
Date: 2026-11-28
Description: Component-wise gradient boosting matching R's mboost semantics,
    implemented with a Rust core and R interface. Supports Gaussian, Binomial, Poisson,
    CoxPH, Weibull, and other families with linear (bols) and smooth
    (bbs) base-learners, as well as GAMLSS (generalized additive models
    for location, scale, and shape) via glmboostLSS and gamboostLSS.
